flowchart TB
    P[Producer / Writer] --> S[Storage layer — Iceberg table]
    S --> PL[Pipeline layer — Spark / dbt jobs]
    PL --> CAT[Catalog layer — DataHub / metadata]
    CAT --> CON[Consumer layer — BI / ML / analysts]

    NF["Netflix: WAP on Iceberg branches\n(prevents bad publishes)"]:::nf -.-> S
    UB["Uber: statistical detection\n(flags anomalies in flight)"]:::ub -.-> PL
    LI["LinkedIn: DataHub assertions\n(quality metadata in catalog)"]:::li -.-> CAT
    AB["Airbnb: DQ Score\n(tells consumer how much to trust)"]:::ab -.-> CON

    classDef nf fill:#e3170a,color:#fff,stroke:#c0392b
    classDef ub fill:#333,color:#fff,stroke:#111
    classDef li fill:#0077b5,color:#fff,stroke:#005885
    classDef ab fill:#ff5a5f,color:#fff,stroke:#e04045
